  fhir:PlanDefinition.description [ fhir:value "Derived (L2) protocol: HemOnc mFOLFOX6 Variant #06 (cui 133145) with the fluorouracil 400 mg/m² bolus omitted, as published by the NZ SACT Regimen Library on 2026-07-01 following the NZ Society for Oncology Gastrointestinal Cancers Special Interest Group recommendation. Oxaliplatin 85 mg/m² IV over 120 min day 1; folinic acid 400 mg/m² IV over 120 min day 1; fluorouracil 2400 mg/m² IV over 46 h day 1; 14-day cycle. Supportive care (antiemetics, loperamide) as per SRL, not reproduced here."] ;
